                "text": "Musk's illegal & arbitrary cuts to NIH will dismantle biomedical research in America as we know it. Labs will shut down. Sick kids won't get the treatment they need.\n\nJust because Elon doesn\u2019t understand indirect costs doesn\u2019t mean Americans should pay the price with their lives.",
